<p style="margin-bottom:7px;margin-top:6px;line-height:16px;font-size:16px;">
<strong>Al Khor Ramadan Nights</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;">An event that brings together culture, community, and creativity along the banks of Dubai Creek. At its heart is a Ramadan Market spotlighting SMEs and homegrown businesses offering thoughtfully curated products, alongside a Ramadan Street Food hub where you can explore diverse culinary offerings and live cooking demonstrations.</p>

<p style="margin:0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.visitdubai.com/en/festivals-and-events/dubai-events-calendar/al-khor-ramadan-nights" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">11 Mar - 14 Mar, Free entry</a></p>

</td>
</tr>
