<p style="margin-bottom:7px;margin-top:6px;line-height:16px;font-size:16px;">
<strong>Art Fest International</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;">Head to Taj Dubai for Art Fest International, a curated international art exhibition from India that showcases contemporary artworks by Indian artists and talent from other countries.</p>

<p style="margin:0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.visitdubai.com/en/festivals-and-events/dubai-events-calendar/art-fest-international" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">13 Mar - 15 Mar, Free entry</a></p>

