<p style="margin-bottom:7px;margin-top:6px;line-height:16px;font-size:16px;">
<strong>Max Amini Live in Dubai</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;">Enjoy an unforgettable night of laughter with Max Amini at Dubai Opera. Expect fresh material, spontaneous crowd moments, and fast-paced stand-up that connects everyday life with global perspectives.</p>

<p style="margin:0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;"><a target="_blank" href="https://dubai.platinumlist.net/event-tickets/104821/max-amini-in-english-live-in-dubai-2026" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Sun 22 Mar - Mon 23 Mar, Tickets start from 60.93 USD (fast selling)</a></p>

