>AED 8,000 - 11,999/month</span>
</mj-text>

<!-- Summary / CTA -->
<mj-text padding="0px 12px 10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">A Dubai-based real estate developer and construction company, ABA PRIME / SIBRIS, is looking for a Senior Finance Manager to oversee financial operations across its development and contracting projects. The role involves managing project budgeting, cost control, financial planning, and cash flow forecasting, while ensuring accurate financial reporting and compliance with UAE VAT regulations. Responsibilities include monitoring project profitability, coordinating with auditors, banks, and authorities, and supporting financial control across construction and development activities. Candidates should have over 10 years of finance experience, including at least five years in construction or real estate development within the UAE.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><a href="https://dubai.dubizzle.com/jobs/accounting-finance/2026/3/12/senior-finance-manager-construction-real-e-2-955---814bd2d0bcd8465082cef9d7e29efc10/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"><strong>Register here </strong></a><strong> </strong></p>
</mj-text>
