        <mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    British tourist held
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">A British tourist has been arrested in Dubai after allegedly <a href="https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-15638665/British-tourist-60-filmed-Iranian-missiles-Dubai-facing-two-years-prison-charged-cybercrime-offence.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">filming missiles</a> striking the city and sharing the footage online, an act authorities say violates cybercrime laws. The 60-year-old Londoner faces up to two years in prison for allegedly circulating material that could disturb public security. Officials have also charged 20 others over similar posts, as the UAE warns against sharing content that could incite panic.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Public sector holidays
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Dubai Government Human Resources Department announced a four-day <a href="https://www.khaleejtimes.com/uae/dubai-announces-eid-al-fitr-2026-holiday-for-public-sector-employees?_refresh=true" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Eid al-Fitr break</a> for Dubai public sector employees from March 19 to March 22, with work resuming on March 23. Federal government workers will receive the same dates, while most private-sector employees will be off March 19-21. International Astronomy Centre said the Shawwal crescent is unlikely to be seen on March 18, suggesting Eid will likely fall on March 20.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Amali Island villa record
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Dubai's property market saw a <a href="https://gulfnews.com/business/property/villa-on-dubais-world-islands-sold-for-dh220-million-in-landmark-deal-1.500471955" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">landmark Dh220Mn sale</a> of a 58,080 sq ft luxury villa on Amali Island in the World Islands, at Dh3,787 per sq ft, per Dubai Land Department data. The deal underscores robust demand amid 2025's surge: 6,668 luxury transactions worth Dh143.8Bn, up 41% in volume and 45% in value from 2024.</p>
</mj-text>
